{"ref":"BDB, תַּ֫יִשׁ","hw":"תַּ֫יִשׁ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תַּ֫יִשׁ</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. he-goat (</strong>NH id.<em>;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">تَيْسٌ</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּיָשָׁא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּישָׁא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܬܳܝܫܳܐ</span> id.<em>;</em> √ unknown<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּ֑יִשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.31\">Pr 30:31</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּיֽשִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">Gn 30:35</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:15\" href=\"/Genesis.32.15\">32:15</a> (E; + <span dir=\"rtl\">עִזִּים</span> she-goats), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.11\">2 Ch 17:11</a>.","next":"BDB, תֹּךְ","prev":"BDB, תִּירָ֑ס"}